{
  "schema_version": "prompt-runtime.program-scenario.v1",
  "story_path": "user_stories/workflow-runs-ports.md",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "AC1",
      "text": "`writeRun` acquires and releases `.ordinary-owner`, increments `journalSeq`, records `updatedAt`, writes `status.json` under `runDir` and `runs.json` under `stateDir`, and fails with `invalid_run_record` when `record.runDir` is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC2",
      "text": "`readRun` reads `status.json` under `runDir` and fails with `invalid_run_dir` when `runDir` is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC3",
      "text": "`updateRun` applies an ordinary state update while clearing `progressAt` when `preserveProgress` is false, and fails with `run_ownership_busy` when `.ordinary-owner` acquisition is refused."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC4",
      "text": "`readRunOwnership` reads `.ordinary-owner` under `runDir` without acquiring or writing, and fails with `invalid_run_dir` when `runDir` is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC5",
      "text": "`updateRunCosts` updates `suiteMinutes` and sets `progressAt` to the prior file `mtimeMs` without advancing `journalSeq`, updating `updatedAt` or calling `metrics.journalRunMutation`, and fails with `run_missing` when `status.json` is absent."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC6",
      "text": "`gitContext` resolves `toplevel` and `commonDir` through `git.revParse` and `fs.realpath`, and fails with `invalid_cwd` when `cwd` is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC7",
      "text": "`runForWorktree` selects an archived `-cancelled-` worktree run before a replacement active run on the same issue and fails with `invalid_cwd` when `cwd` is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC8",
      "text": "`resolveRun`, `listRuns` and `allRuns` resolve and enumerate runs across repositories and `runs.json` under `stateDir` (including archived cancelled folders when `cancelled: true`), and fail on empty `cwd` or `stateDir`."
    }
  ],
